## What the data is not

Roughly **6% of the species total is estimated rather than counted** — 27
families that WCVP circumscribes differently, plus every bryophyte class (WCVP
covers vascular plants only). Divergence ages are one defensible estimate, not a
settled figure; published dates for the same clade routinely differ by tens of
millions of years. Each record carries a `provenance` field saying which of its
values are sourced and which are estimates — please keep that distinction if you
redistribute.

The app's About page documents the method and the known gaps in full.
